  assert.deepEqual(rows.map((r) => [r.id, r.org_id, r.owner_id, r.status]), [[a.id, 1, 41, 'open'], [a.id + 1, 2, null, 'open']]);
  ```

  Evidence: the two edited lines, shown in the diff.

- [ ] 2. Run the suite and confirm both edited tests fail for the expected reason — the source
